# Figures

This folder contains visual outputs from the computational drug-discovery workflow.

## Planned or Uploaded Figures

- Docking poses of the prioritized Gen-2 trifluoromethyl analogue in the HTNV L-protein/RdRp binding site (PDB 8C4T).
- Residue-level interaction maps for HTNV-retained and dual-target candidates.
- ADMET property plots for generated analogues.
- Scaffold-hopping comparison plots.
- Molecular similarity and Bemis–Murcko scaffold analysis figures.
- Exploratory docking poses for tubulin–colchicine-site target PDB 1SA0.

## Important Note

All figures represent computational predictions and are intended for
hypothesis-generating analysis only. No molecular-dynamics simulations or
experimental validation were performed in the present study.
